    "%@\n\n%@ 在那台电脑上没有登录或登录已过期。请在电脑终端里运行 `%@` 登录一次（或在 Conch 里连上终端后登录），然后重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@\n\n%@ isn't signed in on that computer, or the sign-in has expired. Run `%@` once in a terminal on the computer to sign in (or connect a terminal in Conch and sign in there), then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@\n\n%@ 在那台電腦上沒有登入或登入已過期。請在電腦終端里執行 `%@` 登入一次（或在 Conch 里連上終端後登入），然後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
