    },
    "Conch 助手会把你的消息发给 %@ 来生成回复。为了完成你交代的事，它还可能读取并发送：" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conch Assistant sends your messages to %@ to generate replies. To do what you ask, it may also read and send:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conch 助理會把你的訊息傳給 %@ 來產生回覆。為了完成你交代的事，它還可能讀取並傳送："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conch 已在后台保持连接 %@，连接稍后会断开。回到 Conch 会自动重连。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conch kept your connections alive in the background for %@. They'll drop shortly; opening Conch reconnects them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conch 已在後台保持連線 %@，連線稍後會中斷。回到 Conch 會自動重連。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conch 服务器 %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
