        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conch 伺服器 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Conch 本身不收集这些数据，它们只发给上面提到的服务，按各自的隐私政策处理。可以随时在 AI 服务设置里撤回，或关掉快速联网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Conch itself doesn't collect this data. It only goes to the services named above and is handled under their privacy policies. You can withdraw at any time in AI service settings, or turn off fast lookup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
