    "SSH 连上后，在这个终端里让 Claude Code 和 Codex 把输出留在终端的滚动记录里，往回翻在本机滑动，不再每一下都等电脑重绘。只影响 Conch 打开的终端，电脑上照旧。Mosh 没有滚动记录，不适用。新开的终端生效。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Over SSH, Claude Code and Codex in this terminal keep their output in the terminal's scrollback, so scrolling back happens on this device instead of waiting for the computer to redraw each step. Only affects terminals Conch opens; the computer is unchanged. Not for Mosh, which has no scrollback. Applies to new terminals."
