    },
    "iOS 会在 App 离开屏幕约 30 秒后暂停它，连接随之中断。开启后，只要有连接在用，Conch 会用最低精度的定位保持在后台运行（状态栏会显示定位图标）。离开 Conch 超过设定时长、或所有连接都已断开时自动停止。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS pauses apps about 30 seconds after they leave the screen, which drops their connections. When this is on and a connection is in use, Conch keeps running in the background with the lowest-accuracy location (the status bar shows the location icon). It stops after the time you choose, or once every connection has closed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 會在 App 離開螢幕約 30 秒後暫停它，連線隨之中斷。開啓後，只要有連線在用，Conch 會用最低精度的定位保持在後台執行（狀態欄會顯示定位圖標）。離開 Conch 超過設定時長、或所有連線都已中斷時自動停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
