    "不在同一个网络时，比如通过 Tailscale，填对方的地址。对方的地址在它的 设置 › 同步与共享 里，对方需要开着 Conch。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you're not on the same network, for example over Tailscale, enter the other device's address. It's shown in that device's Settings › Sync & Share, and Conch must be open there."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不在同一個網路時，比如透過 Tailscale，填對方的位址。對方的位址在它的 設定 › 同步與共享 裡，對方需要開著 Conch。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不填也能用，只是免 Key 的额度有限，用得多会被限流。填了以后优先用自己的 Key；Key 无效或额度用完时自动退回免 Key。Key 只保存在本机钥匙串里。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Optional. Without keys both services still work, but the free tier is rate-limited when used heavily. Saved keys are used first; if a key is invalid or out of credit, Conch falls back to the free tier. Keys are stored only in this device's keychain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
