    "会把密钥“%@”的公钥追加到 %@ 的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，验证成功后改用密钥登录。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Adds the public key of “%@” to %@'s ~/.ssh/authorized_keys and, once verified, switches to key login."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會把金鑰“%@”的公鑰追加到 %@ 的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，驗證成功後改用金鑰登入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会添加新的服务器、更新较旧的，不会删除这台设备上的任何内容。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "New servers are added and older ones updated. Nothing on this device is deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會新增新的伺服器、更新較舊的，不會刪除這台裝置上的任何內容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会生成一把 Ed25519 密钥，私钥只保存在本机钥匙串中。生成后拷贝公钥，追加到服务器的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys 即可。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Generates an Ed25519 key; the private key stays in this device's keychain. Afterwards, copy the public key and add it to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "會生成一把 Ed25519 金鑰，私鑰只保存在本機鑰匙圈中。生成後拷貝公鑰，追加到伺服器的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys 即可。"
