    "填了 Auth Key 就不用在浏览器里登录（在 Tailscale 后台 › Settings › Keys 生成）。改动在重新连接后生效。\n「优先使用自建中转」：tailnet 里有自建的 DERP 中转时，固定用它，不按延迟挑官方中转。开着代理或 VPN 时，如果别的设备连不上这台手机，可以打开试试；立即生效。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With an auth key you don't need to sign in in the browser (generate one in the Tailscale admin console › Settings › Keys). Changes take effect after reconnecting.\n\"Prefer Own Relay\": when your tailnet has its own DERP relay, always use it instead of picking an official relay by latency. If other devices can't reach this phone while a proxy or VPN is on, try turning it on; takes effect immediately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "填了 Auth Key 就不用在瀏覽器裡登入（在 Tailscale 後台 › Settings › Keys 產生）。改動在重新連線後生效。\n「優先使用自建中繼」：tailnet 裡有自建的 DERP 中繼時，固定用它，不按延遲挑官方中繼。開著代理或 VPN 時，如果別的裝置連不上這支手機，可以打開試試；立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
