    "开" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "on"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启“记录连接地点”后，每次连上服务器都会记下时间和大致地点。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With “Record Connection Locations” on, each connection to a server records the time and rough location."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啓“記錄連線地點”後，每次連上伺服器都會記下時間和大致地點。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，助手会记住你的偏好、环境和纠正过它的做法，新对话里也能用上。你也可以直接对它说“记住……”或“忘掉……”。记忆只保存在本机，但每次对话都会作为上下文发给所选的 AI 服务；不会记密码和密钥。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the assistant remembers your preferences, your setup and the corrections you've made, and uses them in new conversations. You can also just say “remember…” or “forget…”. Memories are stored only on this device, but are sent to the AI service as context in each conversation. Passwords and keys are never remembered."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啓後，助手會記住你的偏好、環境和糾正過它的做法，新對話里也能用上。你也可以直接對它說“記住……”或“忘掉……”。記憶只保存在本機，但每次對話都會作為上下文發給所選的 AI 服務；不會記密碼和金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，每次连上都会进入同名 tmux 会话（没有就新建）。断线重连后回到原来的界面，正在运行的程序不会中断。服务器上需要装有 tmux。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, each connection enters the tmux session with this name (creating it if needed). After a reconnect you're back where you were, and running programs keep going. tmux must be installed on the server."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啓後，每次連上都會進入同名 tmux 會話（沒有就新建）。斷線重連後回到原來的界面，正在執行的程式不會中斷。伺服器上需要裝有 tmux。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
