    "步骤太多，先停在这里。需要的话告诉我继续。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "That took too many steps, so I stopped here. Tell me to continue if needed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步驟太多，先停在這裡。需要的話告訴我繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每 %lld 秒向服务器发一次心跳，防止路由器、防火墙或 Tailscale 因为空闲断开连接；连续 %lld 次（约 %lld 秒）没有回应就判定断线并自动重连。相当于 OpenSSH 的 ServerAliveInterval 和 ServerAliveCountMax。新设置对之后建立的连接生效。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sends a heartbeat every %lld seconds so routers, firewalls or Tailscale don't drop an idle connection; %lld missed replies in a row (about %lld seconds) count as a drop and trigger a reconnect. Same as OpenSSH's ServerAliveInterval and ServerAliveCountMax. Applies to new connections."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每 %lld 秒向伺服器發一次心跳，防止路由器、防火牆或 Tailscale 因為空閒中斷連線；連續 %lld 次（約 %lld 秒）沒有回應就判定斷線並自動重連。相當於 OpenSSH 的 ServerAliveInterval 和 ServerAliveCountMax。新設定對之後建立的連線生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每 2 秒更新 · 通过 SSH 读取，服务器上不用装任何东西" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Updates every 2 seconds · Read over SSH, nothing to install on the server"
