    "用已保存的密码或密钥通过 SFTP 连接，Tailnet 里的服务器走内置 Tailscale。点文件就下载到共享文件夹的“服务器下载”里，同名文件会被替换。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connects over SFTP with the saved password or key; servers on your tailnet go through the built-in Tailscale. Tap a file to download it to “Server Downloads” in the shared folder, replacing any file with the same name."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用已儲存的密碼或金鑰透過 SFTP 連線，Tailnet 裡的伺服器走內建 Tailscale。點檔案就下載到共享資料夾的“伺服器下載”裡，同名檔案會被取代。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
