    "第一次互相发送时核对数字，并选择“这是我自己的设备”。之后在这些设备之间发送不用再核对，对方会自动接收。移除后需要重新核对。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The first time two devices send to each other, compare codes and choose “This is my own device”. After that, transfers between them need no code and are received automatically. Removing a device means comparing codes again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一次互相傳送時核對數字，並選擇「這是我自己的裝置」。之後在這些裝置之間傳送不用再核對，對方會自動接收。移除後需要重新核對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
